   "source": [
    "Linear Regression "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "23ce9a2e-ca0e-4e47-9e93-1167c7cbbf45",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "* Very very basic form of prediction\n",
    "* You are going to have a set of samples\n",
    "    ,about something \n",
    "            - phenomenon\n",
    "            - occurence\n",
    "            - expresions\n",
    "            - Even:\n",
    "* the set of samples will be given in a group of\n",
    "  (x,y) pairs, values\n",
    "\n",
    "* X is known as the independent\n",
    "  variable (does not depend on anything)\n",
    "\n",
    "* Y is the dependent variable\n",
    "  The value of Y, will depend on some other\n",
    "  thing\n",
    "\n",
    "* Apply linear regression to get a model\n",
    "  A model that will allow me to move,\n",
    "  projecton, predictions about a possible\n",
    "  outcome given some expected conditions\n",
    "\n",
    "* Strucure of Model:\n",
    "    Y = mx + b \n",
    "        m = slope [y-units / x-units]\n",
    "        b = y-intercept [y-units]\n",
    "* N = number of samples \n",
    "    number of (x,y) samples\n",
    "\n",
    "* m = N * ⅀(x*y) - (⅀x)*(⅀y) / \n",
    "      N * ⅀(x^2) - (2x)^2\n",
    "* b = ⅀y - m * ⅀x /\n",
    "      N \n",
    "* or b = ⅀y/N - m * ⅀x/N \n",
    "\n",
    "* Example \n",
    "    x = hours of sunshine\n",
    "    y = amount sold \n",
    "            x | y \n",
    "            2 | 4 \n",
    "            3 | 5\n",
    "            5 | 7\n",
    "            7 | 10\n",
    "            9 | 15\n",
    "N = 5 \n",
    "\n",
    "Step 1:  Table\n",
    "\n",
    "            x | y   | x^2 | xy  |  \n",
    "            2 | 4   |  4  | 8   |  \n",
    "            3 | 5   |  9  | 15  |   \n",
    "            5 | 7   | 25  | 35  |\n",
    "            7 | 10  | 49  | 70  |\n",
    "            9 | 15  | 81  | 135 |\n",
    "\n",
    "Step 2:   Calculate components\n",
    "            ⅀x | ⅀y |⅀x^2 | ⅀xy\n",
    "            26 | 41  | 168 | 263\n",
    "\n",
    "Check numbers later ** \n",
    "Step 3: Compute m\n",
    "m = (5 * 263) - (26)(41) /\n",
    "    (5 * 168) - 26^2\n",
    "m = 1315 - 1060/\n",
    "    840 - 696 \n",
    "m = 299/ 164\n",
    "\n",
    "Step 4: Compute b\n",
    "b = 41 - (1.51 * 26)/\n",
    "    5 \n",
    "  = 41 - 39.41\n",
    "  = 2.37/ 5\n",
    "  = .304  \n",
    "\n",
    "Step 5: Put together the Elements that will give you \n",
    "        the model that desvrives the system by:\n",
    "y = 1.51829268293 * x + 0.30487804876\n",
    "\n",
    "prediction for 8 hrs \n",
    "y = 1.51829268293 (8) + 0.30487804876\n",
    "y = 12.1463914693 + 0.30487804876\n",
    "y = 12.4512195122 ice cream sold\n",
    "\n",
    "Step 6: Estimate how good is your model?\n",
    "* compute the correlation coefficient \n",
    " r = N * (⅀xy) - (⅀x)(⅀y) /\n",
    "     (sqrt(N * (⅀x^2) - (⅀x)^2)) * (sqrt(N * (⅀y^2) - (⅀y)^2))\n",
    "            y^2 | ⅀y^2\n",
    "            16  | 415\n",
    "            25\n",
    "            49\n",
    "           100\n",
    "           275 \n",
    "r = (5 * 263) - (26)(41) /\n",
    "    sqrt((5 * 168) - 26^2) * sqrt((5 * 415) - 41^2)\n",
    "r = 1315 - 1066 /\n",
    "    sqrt(840 -676) * sqrt(2075 - 1681) \n",
    "  = 249/ \n",
    "    sqrt(164) * sqrt(394) \n",
    "  = 249/ \n",
    "    254.196774174\n",
    "r = 0.97556097079 \n",
    "if r = -1 or 1 = trustable 100% fit \n",
    "if r = 0 = not trustable no fit at all \n",
    "as r approaches 0 the linear correlation \n",
    "decreases\n",
    "\n",
    "anything under 0.8 or 0.85 shouldn't be trusted\n",
    "\n",
    "so our model is very tristable as it shows \n",
    "a strong linear relationship between \n",
    "dependent and independent variables\n"
   ]
  },
